#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up an online lab environment to use Qiskit in the cloud. Choose a "
"preconfigured environment or set up your own."
msgstr ""
"Configura un ambiente di laboratorio online per usare Qiskit nel cloud. "
"Scegli un ambiente preconfigurato o configurane uno tuo."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments"
msgstr "Ambienti di laboratorio online"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments {#online-lab-environments}"
msgstr "Ambienti di laboratorio online {#online-lab-environments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In addition to downloading and installing Qiskit to work on your local "
"machine, there are several options available for those who prefer to work in"
" an online development environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oltre a scaricare e installare Qiskit per lavorare sulla tua macchina "
"locale, sono disponibili diverse opzioni per chi preferisce lavorare in un "
"ambiente di sviluppo online.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Several providers offer online Jupyter environments with Qiskit preinstalled"
" for fast and convenient onboarding. These recommended providers include the"
" cloud service provider OVHcloud and the quantum software development cloud "
"platform qBraid.\n"
msgstr ""
"Diversi provider offrono ambienti Jupyter online con Qiskit preinstallato "
"per un avvio rapido e conveniente. Tra i provider consigliati ci sono il "
"provider di servizi cloud OVHcloud e la piattaforma cloud per lo sviluppo di"
" software quantistico qBraid.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Recommended notebook environments with Qiskit preinstalled {#recommended-"
"notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"
msgstr ""
"Ambienti notebook consigliati con Qiskit preinstallato {#recommended-"
"notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional online Jupyter notebook environments like IBM Watson&reg; Studio,"
" Google Colab, and Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio can be used to "
"work with Qiskit by following the appropriate instructions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Altri ambienti Jupyter notebook online come IBM Watson&reg; Studio, Google "
"Colab e Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio possono essere usati con "
"Qiskit seguendo le istruzioni appropriate.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud AI notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"
msgstr "Notebook AI di OVHcloud {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"OVHcloud Public Cloud and OVHcloud Startup users can use their OVHcloud "
"quantum notebooks to access Qiskit and submit jobs to IBM&reg; QPUs with "
"their IBM Quantum&reg; or IBM Cloud&reg; account. To learn more, visit the "
"[OVHcloud Documentation and tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-"
"documentation?id=kb_home) page.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gli utenti di OVHcloud Public Cloud e OVHcloud Startup possono usare i "
"propri notebook quantistici OVHcloud per accedere a Qiskit e inviare job "
"alle QPU IBM&reg; con il proprio account IBM Quantum&reg; o IBM Cloud&reg;. "
"Per saperne di più, visita la pagina [Documentazione e tutorial di "
"OVHcloud](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-documentation?id=kb_home).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"OVHcloud AI notebooks are not available in some regions, such as the United States. Additionally, user interfaces might look different in different regions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"I notebook AI di OVHcloud non sono disponibili in alcune regioni, come gli Stati Uniti. Inoltre, le interfacce utente potrebbero avere un aspetto diverso a seconda della regione.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to get started:\n"
msgstr "Segui questi passaggi per iniziare:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Crea un account IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Set up an OVHcloud account](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-"
"create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Configura un account OVHcloud](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-"
"create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create an OVH Public Cloud project](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea un progetto OVH Public Cloud](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-"
"us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in [Launch your first AI "
"Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), selecting "
"**Qiskit** for the framework.\n"
msgstr ""
"Segui i passaggi in [Avvia il tuo primo AI "
"Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-"
"definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), selezionando "
"**Qiskit** come framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"
msgstr "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit users can use qBraid's preconfigured Python environments by following"
" these instructions. For more information, see the [qBraid "
"Docs](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"
msgstr ""
"Gli utenti di Qiskit possono usare gli ambienti Python preconfigurati di "
"qBraid seguendo queste istruzioni. Per ulteriori informazioni, consulta la "
"[documentazione di qBraid](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an qBraid free account](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Configura un account gratuito su "
"qBraid](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Create a Lab environment](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started).\n"
msgstr ""
"[Crea un ambiente Lab](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-"
"started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Launch qBraid Lab, click the **ENVS** icon on the right, click **+ ADD** at "
"the top of the new sidebar, and search for Qiskit.  Click the version you "
"want to use, then click **Install**.\n"
msgstr ""
"Avvia qBraid Lab, clicca sull'icona **ENVS** a destra, clicca su **+ ADD** "
"in cima alla nuova barra laterale e cerca Qiskit. Clicca sulla versione che "
"vuoi usare, poi clicca su **Install**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a Jupyter notebook by clicking **Python 3 [Qiskit]** in the Notebook "
"section.\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea un Jupyter notebook cliccando su **Python 3 [Qiskit]** nella sezione "
"Notebook.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can install any additional Python packages (Such as Qiskit v1.2) in a "
"notebook cell by running `%pip install [package_name].` For more "
"information, see the [Pip (magic) "
"commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puoi installare pacchetti Python aggiuntivi (come Qiskit v1.2) in una cella "
"del notebook eseguendo `%pip install [package_name].` Per ulteriori "
"informazioni, consulta l'argomento [Comandi Pip "
"(magic)](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-"
"commands).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Additional notebook environments for Qiskit users {#additional-notebook-"
"environments-for-qiskit-users}"
msgstr ""
"Ambienti notebook aggiuntivi per gli utenti Qiskit {#additional-notebook-"
"environments-for-qiskit-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For platforms without Qiskit preconfigured, the setup instructions are "
"similar, except that you must install Qiskit manually. You will create an "
"account, start a new project (or notebook or workspace, depending on the "
"platform), and install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Per le piattaforme senza Qiskit preconfigurato, le istruzioni di "
"configurazione sono simili, tranne per il fatto che devi installare Qiskit "
"manualmente. Dovrai creare un account, avviare un nuovo progetto (o notebook"
" o workspace, a seconda della piattaforma) e installare Qiskit.\n"

